; Copy to <map>.ini and replace coordinates using bf4_objective_origin in-game.
; No fabricated coordinates are supplied. All numbers must be integers.
;
; point <A..G> <x> <y> <z> <radius 1..1024>
; spawn <T|CT|BOTH> <base|A..G> <x> <y> <z> <yaw -360..360>
;
; Domination requires exactly 3 points. Conquest supports 1..7 points.
; Existing map player starts are added automatically as base spawns.
; Domination uses both teams' map starts; Conquest keeps their team assignment.
; Conquest point spawn origins must be within the corresponding point radius.
; Measure a standing player's center, NOT floor height. Use safe, level surfaces.
; Duplicate point IDs, missing references and malformed rows reject the entire layout.
;
; Example grammar only (replace every placeholder; do not uncomment as-is):
; point A <x> <y> <z> 160
; point B <x> <y> <z> 160
; point C <x> <y> <z> 160
; spawn BOTH A <x> <y> <z> 90
